00:01:22.893 --> 00:01:24.924
It can happen, but it's very rare.

00:01:24.924 --> 00:01:26.980
This is why selling to
entrepreneurs is usually

00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:30.195
a really terrible idea,
because, I love entrepreneurs,

00:01:30.195 --> 00:01:33.141
and it's a rough business
